    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. To make the literature review more robust, I need to differentiate between the different types of evidence they point to. Could you expand on the specific biological or evolutionary theories they use to explain why these gaps would exist? Like, what are the actual mechanisms they usually talk about when they try to provide a scientific basis for it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
