      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful for the theoretical part. I also want to make sure I'm capturing how they use specific data to ground these theories. Could you mention some of the specific metrics or prominent studies they frequently cite to claim these differences are measurable and widespread? Basically, what kind of 'hard data' do they present to support the idea that these cognitive differences are actual biological realities?",
